  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはよう\r\nん、それは……音楽プレイヤーか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001000310020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい、ちょっと聴いていたんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100200100031/1002001000310020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（灯織のイヤホンから、すこし音楽が\r\n漏れて聞こえてくるな……）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "俺のオススメを\r\n教えよう",
    "nextLabel": "1002001000311"
  },
  {
    "select": "俺もそのアーティスト、\r\n好きだぞ",
    "nextLabel": "1002001000312"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "音楽聴くのが\r\n好きなんだな",
    "nextLabel": "1002001000313"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001000310030,
    "label": "1002001000311",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "最近、同じアーティストばかり\r\n聴いていたので……ありがたいです",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100200100031/1002001000310030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001000310040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それで、どんな曲がオススメなんですか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100200100031/1002001000310040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001000310050,
    "label": "1002001000312",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうなんですか\r\nいいですよね、落ち着いた曲が多くて……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100200100031/1002001000310050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001000310060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーと趣味が合うなんて、\r\n意外でした",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100200100031/1002001000310060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001000310070,
    "label": "1002001000313",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "好き、というよりは趣味なだけです\r\n何かしながらでも聴けるので……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100200100031/1002001000310070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001000310080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それにイヤホンをしていれば、\r\n誰も話しかけてきませんから",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
